  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd really like to opt out of seeing the same X amount of tips while I load into worlds. I have over 1k hours I really don't want to be constantly reminded of these little things I already know how to do.\nWhat I propose: I really like seeing screenshots I have saved in my VRC folder as a replacement for these tips. It just reminds me of why I play in the first place. Seeing photos of my friends/ memories. \nI would also like to see more customization options for color. I really want to be able to change my menu color // quick menu color // laser color // etc- \nI think these are two really easy things, that could be easily implemented. These would be such a nice quality of life change for so many users.",
